Muskan Paliwal <muskan10112002@gmail.com> Thu Oct 15 14:30:47 2026 +0530

fix(review): skip severity headings in prose findings without grouping by them

A line holding only a severity, such as "### High" or "**Low:**", ends
the current finding and is not posted as one. Findings under it no
longer take its severity, and text under it that is not a list item is
no longer kept as a finding. Main never grouped by heading, and the
skip alone is enough to keep headings out of the posted findings.

